{
  "id": "unique-event-032",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "  #32 - the halloween gang\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,718,745]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Make a L4 Charisma roll. Add +1 if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,745,780]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have Charisma Skill and +2 if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,780,814]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have Charisma (Expert). If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,814,849]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "succeed, the youth will let the kid\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,849,885]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "go. If you fail, the teenagers try to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,885,923]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "kill you. You’ll have to use deadly\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,923,959]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "force.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,959,966]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Halloween gang, 6 L3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,966,991]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "criminals, 1 Life each, damage 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,991,1024]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(knives and sticks).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1024,1045]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you defeat them, the kid will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1045,1078]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "explain what happened.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1078,1101]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "He was once part of that gang. He\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1101,1135]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "used to wear a rubber clown\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1135,1163]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "mask, like the clown, Walrus, who\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1163,1197]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "used to set up clown shows next\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1197,1229]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to the railway station. “They said\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1229,1264]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the mask talked to them and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1264,1292]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "made them stronger, but that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1292,1321]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "never happened to me,“ he\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1321,1347]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "explains.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1347,1357]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": " “They were afraid of the other kids\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1357,1394]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "– the witches... A group of younger\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1394,1430]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "children who used magic books to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1430,1463]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "cast spells. I think it’s been them\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1463,1499]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "who caused all this mess with the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1499,1533]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "zombies and the monsters. They\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1533,1564]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "messed up with magic, they called\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1564,1598]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "demons by saying their names\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1598,1627]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "seven times at midnight, in front\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1627,1661]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of a black mirror. I thought these\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1661,1696]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "were only scary stories, but now I\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1696,1731]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "know they are real.”\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1731,1752]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "From now, if at any point in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1752,1785]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "game you want to look for Walrus\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1785,1818]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Clown, you can automatically\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1818,1851]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "get result 1 on the Railways table.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,1851,1886]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If at any point you have a black\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,22,55]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "mirror, know the true name of a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,55,87]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "demon, and want to perform the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,87,118]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-032:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "black mirror ritual, go to event #28.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,118,156]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    91,
    92
  ]
}
